{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/9eba6f4be7b48230dc65b81508a54ff6.avif?t=1752880043\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Bean There, Swung That</i></strong> is a fast-paced 3D platformer built around momentum-based grappling hook movement. Swing through expansive levels, collect checkpoints, avoid deadly crashes, and chain together precise grapples to reach the finish line as quickly as possible. Race solo or against up to 10 friends in online multiplayer. Remember, every second, and every swing counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/670d8a255954a7944a2a8b275ef67211.poster.avif?t=1752880043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/670d8a255954a7944a2a8b275ef67211.webm?t=1752880043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/670d8a255954a7944a2a8b275ef67211.mp4?t=1752880043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/c40825a4fa800ca231eba18962680894.avif?t=1752880043\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced grappling hook movement with no speed cap\u2014go as fast as your skill allows. Just don't crash: almost any collision means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/1ff2b2d82c076fa339de235c3314896f.poster.avif?t=1752880043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/1ff2b2d82c076fa339de235c3314896f.webm?t=1752880043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/1ff2b2d82c076fa339de235c3314896f.mp4?t=1752880043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete for medals and try to beat times set by the developers themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against up to 10 friends in online multiplayer lobbies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">90 handcrafted levels across 5 unique themes\u2014each a playground for speedrunning mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/d6508b2114815f5a349f41d49cb02020.poster.avif?t=1752880043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/d6508b2114815f5a349f41d49cb02020.webm?t=1752880043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321060/extras/d6508b2114815f5a349f41d49cb02020.mp4?t=1752880043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your look with unlockable skins, trails, and grappling hooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your own path. Levels are designed as obstacle courses with multiple routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push your limits with brutally difficult challenge levels meant for only the most skilled players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321060?t=1752880043","background_raw":"ht